{"id":1050403,"chapter_id":1050403,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"<i>“从灰黑的沼泽地冲破而出，你们终于见到了和煦的阳光。”</i>","style":2,"background":1002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"<i>“可是冒险家们也知道，这样的阳光无法持续太久，太阳一直在被黑暗的力量胁迫，无法充足地照耀这片土地。”</i>","style":2,"background":1002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"<i>“你们需要在太阳还在的这段时间里，找到前往城堡的方法。”</i>","style":2,"background":1002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"<i>“此时，一向见多识广的游荡者海拉提出了自己的想法。”</i>","style":2,"background":1002,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"几人从MBCC跑出来后，跟着你的指引，来到了辛迪加与新城交接的地方。","style":3,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"你声情并茂地讲完属于你的台词，将话题抛给了身后的海拉。","style":3,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"海拉","content":"咦……诶……？啊啊！对！我们现在呢，正在世界的东西分界处。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"海拉","content":"因为啊，太阳是从西边落下去的，所以西边总是会得到更多一点的阳光。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"海拉","content":"这样的阳光，自……自养……哦哦滋养！滋养出了一个什么都有的集市！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"尽管差点咬到舌头，海拉还是将必要信息说了出来。","style":3,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"原来之前看到的聚落，是个集市啊~正好，这样混杂的集市是信息的聚集地，不管怎样，一定能找到一些蛛丝马迹。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"就算找不到……我们也可以摆摊收集信息~","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"九十九","content":"摆摊收集？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"哼哼，就是支个小摊，等价交换~可以交换信息，也可以以物易物~换取我们需要的东西~","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"speaker":"九十九","content":"但我们除了一袋糙面包，就没什么……","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_15"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"这你就不懂了~这样的小摊，靠的是话术和运气~","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"爱缇眨了眨眼，同时指了指自己的脑袋。","style":3,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哦~我懂，这不就空手套白狼嘛，我也会！到时候咱俩一起摆！你七我三！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_18"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"嗯……我会考虑一下的。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_19"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"提示，违法乱纪的话我会终止游戏的。","style":2,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"……","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"speaker":"海拉","content":"啧……死心眼！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"speaker":"海拉","content":"我们悄悄摆，不告诉他！","female_content":"我们悄悄摆，不告诉她！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_23","vo_trial_50403_1_23f"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"<i>“自从太阳被黑暗威胁，太阳消失的时间也会逐渐加快，时间一分一秒地过去，冒险家们还未想到更好的方法，天空已经开始变暗了。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"<i>“商人们点起铺头的灯光，抓紧最后一点交易的时间。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"海拉","content":"啊？这么快？！喂，你是不是故意的啊！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403026,"trial_step":26},{"step":27,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"……命运之神可真会使绊子啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403027,"trial_step":27},{"step":28,"content":"<i>“命运总是喜欢捉弄他人。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403028,"trial_step":28},{"step":29,"content":"顶着爱缇不悦的眼神，你耸了耸肩。","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403029,"trial_step":29},{"step":30,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"算了，你也说了，太阳消失的时间会逐渐加快，这是合理的。现在已经天黑了，来不及了。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403030,"trial_step":30},{"step":31,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"反正我们也都是第一次到这个集市，很多事情都不太熟，贸然摆摊或许也拿不到什么收获。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403031,"trial_step":31},{"step":32,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"今天就干脆先逛逛看吧，如果有需要的话，明天再来摆摊。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403032,"trial_step":32},{"step":33,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"但是，现在天黑了，我认为贸然走进这个市场，可能会有危险发生——我想先查看一下里面的情况。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403033,"trial_step":33},{"step":34,"content":"爱缇朝你抬抬下巴，示意你将骰子拿过来。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403034,"trial_step":34},{"step":35,"content":"爱缇将骰子裹在两手之间，轻轻地摇晃起来，随后向你一抛。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403035,"trial_step":35},{"step":36,"content":"你伸手接住骰子，打开一看——是大成功。","style":3,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403036,"trial_step":36},{"step":37,"content":"<i>“法师爱缇跳上了小巷边缘的建筑，鸟瞰着整个集市。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403037,"trial_step":37},{"step":38,"content":"<i>“和她预想的一样，集市里鱼龙混杂，来来往往的人都非常神秘，但她能感受到，大部分人依旧只是为了生活和生存而聚集在这里的。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403038,"trial_step":38},{"step":39,"content":"<i>“他们不会构成威胁，但也可能无法带来有用的讯息。”</i>","style":2,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403039,"trial_step":39},{"step":40,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"能确定他们不会对我们有危险，但能不能获得讯息，还未确定。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403040,"trial_step":40},{"step":41,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"不过……既然“命运”没有否定我的提问，那说明……我们可以放心地进去寻找。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":1001,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403041,"trial_step":41},{"step":42,"content":"爱缇稍加思索，带着海拉和九十九便钻进了巷子里。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403042,"trial_step":42},{"step":43,"content":"面前的小巷实际上空无一人，但爱缇每个巷口都看得格外仔细，连带着海拉都忍不住跟着一起左看看，右看看。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403043,"trial_step":43},{"step":44,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"让我看看，这附近都有些什么店呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403044,"trial_step":44},{"step":45,"content":"<i>“集市上最多的，是贩卖粮食与药水的铺子，卖着容易成长的糙米做成的糙面包，以及魔力含量极少的回复药水。”</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403045,"trial_step":45},{"step":46,"content":"<i>“偶尔也有一些看上去神神秘秘的店子，四散在靠近里面的拐角处。”</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403046,"trial_step":46},{"step":47,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我对东面那家铺子有点好奇，它在外面摆了一个蓝色的沙发。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_47"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403047,"trial_step":47},{"step":48,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我们要过去看看吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403048,"trial_step":48},{"step":49,"content":"爱缇单手扶着墙上的招牌，踮着脚站在石柱顶端，居高临下地对你们说道。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403049,"trial_step":49},{"step":50,"content":"你仰着头，接过了她的话。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403050,"trial_step":50},{"step":51,"content":"<i>“冒险家们正在四处寻找可以交换情报的店铺，而这时，一个声音从小巷里传到了冒险家们的耳朵中。”</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403051,"trial_step":51},{"step":52,"content":"你把手缩回口袋，轻轻地按了两下藏在口袋里的通讯终端。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403052,"trial_step":52},{"step":53,"content":"附近的小巷里传来一阵叮铃哐啷的声音和倒吸冷气的声音后，你们终于听到了一个女性的声音传来。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403053,"trial_step":53},{"step":54,"speaker":"？？？","content":"哦！迷茫的小羔羊们，你们这是在寻找着什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403054,"trial_step":54},{"step":55,"speaker":"？？？","content":"看看啊！你们弱小，无助，胆怯又可怜的眼神！！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_55"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403055,"trial_step":55},{"step":56,"speaker":"？？？","content":"不如来我这边，臣服在伟大的，高贵的，勇猛的西区霸王艾米潘身边，说不定，我能给你们命运的指引——","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403056,"trial_step":56},{"step":57,"content":"熟悉的声音刚开始还有点断断续续，但越到后面就越发地顺畅，似乎都能想象到这个人正在做什么动作。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403057,"trial_step":57},{"step":58,"speaker":"海拉","content":"切……这家伙绝对一定肯定自己加词儿了，这都什么跟什么啊。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403058,"trial_step":58},{"step":59,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"哦？西区霸王？倒是有点意思……本来我还不抱希望今天能收获点什么呢……","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403059,"trial_step":59},{"step":60,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"看来，命运给我们指引了一条相当明显的路线呀。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403060,"trial_step":60},{"step":61,"content":"爱缇纵身一跃，落在了你的身边，微微一笑。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403061,"trial_step":61},{"step":62,"content":"<i>“冒险家们虽然觉得这个声音有点可疑，但毕竟现在更重要的是获得线索，于是决定会会这个西区霸王。”</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403062,"trial_step":62},{"step":63,"content":"你有些心虚地别过脸，推了推跟在爱缇身后的海拉和九十九。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403063,"trial_step":63},{"step":64,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哼，不就是个区区不才西区霸王吗！跟我聪明伶俐机智可爱的美少女海拉一比肯定也是差了多了。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403064,"trial_step":64},{"step":65,"speaker":"海拉","content":"法师爱缇，你就放心地去和她交换情报吧！我罩着你！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403065,"trial_step":65},{"step":66,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"嘿哟！你罩着她？你个小不点跳起来有人家的法杖高吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403066,"trial_step":66},{"step":67,"speaker":"海拉","content":"呵呵！那你的智商数值加起来有人家的鞋码大吗！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403067,"trial_step":67},{"step":68,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"你！！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403068,"trial_step":68},{"step":69,"content":"一阵急风吹过，方才还在小巷的“西区霸王”，堂堂登场在你们面前。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403069,"trial_step":69},{"step":70,"content":"她脸上张牙舞爪地，和海拉不相上下。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403070,"trial_step":70},{"step":71,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"听好了，小矮子！我手上可是有传说中的城堡的线索！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_71"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403071,"trial_step":71},{"step":72,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"这可是千载难逢多少人想买都买不到的线索！想要的话就乖乖臣服在本霸王的脚底下！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403072,"trial_step":72},{"step":73,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你的线索是关于传说中的城堡？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403073,"trial_step":73},{"step":74,"content":"听到艾米潘的话，爱缇一步跨到了她和海拉之间，盯着艾米潘瞧了起来。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403074,"trial_step":74},{"step":75,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"是、是啊，怎么，你们感兴趣？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_75"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403075,"trial_step":75},{"step":76,"content":"艾米潘吞了吞口水，眼神游移地看了你一眼。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403076,"trial_step":76},{"step":77,"content":"你握了握拳，示意她加油。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403077,"trial_step":77},{"step":78,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"不过，这位少女，我看你眼神坚定姿势清奇，很有天分啊，要不要和我签订契约，成为西区霸王的拜把子朋友？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_78"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403078,"trial_step":78},{"step":79,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"我？你是怎么看出来我能力高强天生强者掌控命运无与伦比的？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_79"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403079,"trial_step":79},{"step":80,"content":"艾米潘愣了愣，一下子接不上话来。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403080,"trial_step":80},{"step":81,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"倒……倒也没看出来这么多……","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_81"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403081,"trial_step":81},{"step":82,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"没有？！真的没有？？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403082,"trial_step":82},{"step":83,"content":