p":119,"content":"可是艾米潘并没有完全倒下……！","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403122,"trial_step":122},{"step":120,"speaker":"九十九","content":"被她逃开了！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_123"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403123,"trial_step":123},{"step":121,"content":"<i>“为了能在西区存活下去，艾米潘锻炼出了极高的闪避数值，因此躲过了九十九的致命攻击！“</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403124,"trial_step":124},{"step":122,"speaker":"九十九","content":"爱缇当心，她冲着你来了！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_125"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403125,"trial_step":125},{"step":123,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"哈哈哈！什么巨龙使者！接受我效果叠加三倍的闪光箭攻击吧！噔噔噔噔！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_126"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403126,"trial_step":126},{"step":124,"speaker":"海拉","content":"辛迪加之耻！正常人谁点那么高的闪避啊！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_127"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403127,"trial_step":127},{"step":125,"speaker":"海拉","content":"爱缇小心！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_128"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403128,"trial_step":128},{"step":126,"content":"情急之下，海拉拿着水管，挡在了爱缇面前。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403129,"trial_step":129},{"step":127,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哪有法师跑到近战面前的道理！看我不打爆你的闪光箭！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403130,"trial_step":130},{"step":128,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"海……海拉？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403131,"trial_step":131},{"step":129,"content":"闪光箭的光芒急速扩大，所有人都忍不住闭上眼睛，隔绝这强烈的光芒。","style":3,"background":10006,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403132,"trial_step":132},{"step":130,"content":"光芒散去后，你却发现爱缇和海拉并肩站着，在海拉的鼻梁上，还带着一副明显偏大的墨镜。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403133,"trial_step":133},{"step":131,"content":"你认出来，那是她在离开审查室时，从工作人员那里获得的。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403134,"trial_step":134},{"step":132,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"这……这是从哪冒出来的墨镜！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403135,"trial_step":135},{"step":133,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"是我宝物库里的宝物——暗黑深渊淬炼连体晶片！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403136,"trial_step":136},{"step":134,"speaker":"海拉","content":"是墨镜。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_137"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403137,"trial_step":137},{"step":135,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"暗黑深渊淬炼连体晶片。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403138,"trial_step":138},{"step":136,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"……","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403139,"trial_step":139},{"step":137,"content":"<i>“因为爱缇及时为海拉装备上了一副墨镜……”</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403140,"trial_step":140},{"step":138,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"暗黑深渊淬炼连体晶片。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_141"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403141,"trial_step":141},{"step":139,"content":"<i>“暗黑深渊淬炼连体晶片，游荡者海拉不仅躲过了吟游诗人艾米潘的攻击，还因为晶片的反射作用，将艾米潘仅剩的一点体力给消耗殆尽！”</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403142,"trial_step":142},{"step":140,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"啊？！就没了？！我后面还有好几句词……","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_143"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403143,"trial_step":143},{"step":141,"content":"嗯？","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403144,"trial_step":144},{"step":142,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"啊……没有，没有。咳咳……","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403145,"trial_step":145},{"step":143,"content":"艾米潘夸张地扶着自己额头，原地转了一圈后，重重地跪倒在地。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403146,"trial_step":146},{"step":144,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"在最后的最后……我想问你……","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_147"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403147,"trial_step":147},{"step":145,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"法师爱缇，你到底……是如何看出……我根本不知道线索是真是假……","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_148"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403148,"trial_step":148},{"step":146,"content":"爱缇扶了扶帽子，扯扯小马甲，清了清嗓子，在艾米潘面前走来走去。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403149,"trial_step":149},{"step":147,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你的表演几乎是完美的，但……就是那么1%的行动方式。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_150"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403150,"trial_step":150},{"step":148,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你拒绝了直接将线索交给我——拒绝承认我这个能力高强天生强者掌控命运无与伦比的完美法师。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_151"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403151,"trial_step":151},{"step":149,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"也就是说，你根本不知道线索是真是假，你只是想要一个免费的帮你鉴定真伪的劳力罢了。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_152"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403152,"trial_step":152},{"step":150,"content":"说完最后一句话，爱缇自信地回头，对艾米潘露出一个高傲的微笑。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403153,"trial_step":153},{"step":151,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"原……原来如此啊！是我……是我太弱了！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_154"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403154,"trial_step":154},{"step":152,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"但是，但是我是真的有一条关于城堡的线索！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_155"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403155,"trial_step":155},{"step":153,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"我愿意免费贡献给你们！但……但我希望你们能够让我也加入冒险小队，如何？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_156"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403156,"trial_step":156},{"step":154,"speaker":"海拉","content":"可你不是死了吗……？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_157"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403157,"trial_step":157},{"step":155,"content":"<i>“嗯……吟游诗人艾米潘在选择技能时，额外挑选了一个“被重创后能自动回复1点体力值，但五十回合只能触发一次”的技能。”</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403158,"trial_step":158},{"step":156,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"这技能也太反复了……真的触发了吗？！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_159"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403159,"trial_step":159},{"step":157,"content":"咳咳，GM（管理者）判定触发了，那肯定是触发了。","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403160,"trial_step":160},{"step":158,"content":"<i>“但究竟是否要让她加入冒险家的小队，三位成员可以好好商量一下。”</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403161,"trial_step":161},{"step":159,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哎呀这技能那技能的也太复杂了！我……我懒得管了！爱缇决定就好！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_162"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403162,"trial_step":162},{"step":160,"speaker":"九十九","content":"嗯，让爱缇决定吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_163"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403163,"trial_step":163},{"step":161,"content":"被艾米潘这些弯弯绕绕的技能给弄昏头，海拉干脆大手一挥，懒得管这一堆情况，拉着九十九就往旁边一坐。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403164,"trial_step":164},{"step":162,"content":"被推到决策位上的爱缇轻轻笑笑，单手叉腰，一脸得意。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403165,"trial_step":165},{"step":163,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"加入进来当然没问题，只是……","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_166"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403166,"trial_step":166},{"step":164,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"只……只是什么？","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_167"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403167,"trial_step":167},{"step":165,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"你需要把线索免费提供给我们，以及……告诉我们你拿到线索的来、龙、去、脉。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_168"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403168,"trial_step":168},{"step":166,"content":"艾米潘忙不迭地点了点头，坐在地上，事无巨细地交代起了自己拿到线索的过程。","style":3,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403169,"trial_step":169},{"step":167,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"果然！是东边那家有蓝色沙发的店子！我第一眼就觉得它不一般。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_170"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403170,"trial_step":170},{"step":168,"speaker":"爱缇","content":"既然如此，我们赶紧出发吧！越早找到线索，到达城堡，就能越快解决这片黑暗！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_171"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403171,"trial_step":171},{"step":169,"speaker":"艾米潘","content":"我赞成！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_172"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403172,"trial_step":172},{"step":170,"speaker":"海拉","content":"哼哼，救世的事情，怎么能少得了我海拉呢？对吧！九十九！","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_173"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403173,"trial_step":173},{"step":171,"speaker":"九十九","content":"嗯，没错。","voice":["vo_trial_50403_1_174"],"voice_bank":"vo_etti_trial","style":1,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403174,"trial_step":174},{"step":172,"content":"<i>“新增一位成员的冒险家队伍，决定即刻出发，前往售卖线索给艾米潘的商人处。”</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403175,"trial_step":175},{"step":173,"content":"<i>“他们踏着夜色，无畏地前进着，无论前方等待他们的是欺诈，还是荆棘，我相信……他们一定会克服一切困难，把握命运的方向，为这个世界……重新带回光明。”</i>","style":2,"background":2016,"log_type":1,"src_id":150403176,"trial_step":176}]}